    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/x-hub/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "X Hub is a modern, lightweight WordPress theme designed for blogs, online magazines, and content-rich websites. Built with clean code and optimized for speed, X Hub delivers fast page loads and a seamless reading experience across all devices. The fully responsive design adapts beautifully to desktops, tablets, and smartphones, ensuring your content looks great everywhere. X Hub features a customizable header with logo support, a flexible navigation menu, post carousels, and a clean typography system powered by Google Fonts. It is SEO-friendly, accessibility-ready, and compatible with popular plugins like WooCommerce and Jetpack. Whether you run a personal blog, a news portal, or a niche magazine, X Hub gives you the tools to create a professional, engaging website without writing a single line of code."
    },
